   "category": "主食面点",
   "steps": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "这个教程是给完全小白看的，所以会有点啰嗦。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106746914-1.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/57db1adac1fc479b806bf8c16e980a82_756w_1008h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "酵母量似乎有点多了？",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106746914-2.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/1abff816e928431fb2b0977c4e70d3fb_756w_1008h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "是为了和后面的出馒头量做对比的。不是固定的。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106746914-3.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/32153fe53bb542a0a16247679ad53ae7_756w_1008h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "Emmm，水的冷热随意，不要太热会烫坏，最高温度也就温开水的程度吧。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106746914-4.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/cdd01fd626344fee9b526535914dc393_1080w_2248h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "高手随意",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106746914-5.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/78002dfc342240e88e00b92bfe38a43c_1008w_756h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "本来就是写给我的小白室友们看的，我怕他们连面絮是什么也不知道。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106746914-6.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/c46cc597e46540069754a6cb144c888e_1008w_756h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "我喜欢硬的。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106746914-7.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/dea6b58cc42242e88422a5fc7ff8b4b6_1008w_756h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 8,
     "text": "碗边的面要及时扣下来",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106746914-8.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/9d3040c4d9d34eafbda2a294485b9270_756w_1008h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 9,
     "text": "其实保鲜膜不透气，我不喜欢。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106746914-9.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/4c08afaa6ddc48ccada51549ebad1fa8_756w_1008h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 10,
     "text": "这还远着呢",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106746914-10.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/1829becba4f5425bb55a224e2765d565_756w_1008h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 11,
     "text": "最好的发酵是一打开盖子带微酸的。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106746914-11.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/043b9efdd8af4e63a0dd3b6e1d076984_756w_1008h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 12,
     "text": "话说我也是第一次注意这些。发过头就烙成饼吧，很香。或者当成老面用吧，也很香。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106746914-12.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/b251dda4e5cc4613a49fca977c77ea5b_756w_1008h.jpg"
