    {
     "n": 13,
     "text": "普通的面团",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106746914-13.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/ab27fa2ac6d74cf8bd525f14e504086a_1080w_1427h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 14,
     "text": "普通的内部结构，所以还要揉，当然揉到这停下也可以，没太大区别。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106746914-14.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/9ef49c5ea566481a991332fb9965355c_756w_1008h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 15,
     "text": "呛面馒头开始了",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106746914-15.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/f9761ef0cb924b4e88408a7f507c19bd_756w_1008h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 16,
     "text": "看来我把我的室友想象的很小白",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106746914-16.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/6408c4ddaaca42f1917f37adee11a7cb_1008w_756h.jpg"
