   "category": "主食面点",
   "steps": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "准备一个鸡蛋，适量酵母、盐、一碗水【也可准备半包牛奶】",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106549495-1.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/53adcfdcc77e4f4780d1ec5dc46ea8f0_1280w_960h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "加入面粉，用筷子搅拌成这种糊糊状，不能太干，不然炸出来小油条比较硬",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-22/steps/106549495-2.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/6a497917312049d0bb966d81d9c966d9_1280w_960h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
